# F5 Daily Run

F5 → `workbench.action.tasks.test` when `pipela.f5BuildAndRun` is true in `.vscode/settings.json`.
Terminal must show **`Started Pipela.exe`** — not blank, not CodeLLDB/cppvsdbg daily path.
`launch.json` `configurations: []`. Do not add lldb daily config.
Regress: `scripts/fix-cursor-f5.ps1` or `scripts/ensure-dev-isolation.ps1` + Reload Window.
